**Month 1:** Start learning: arrays, linked lists (data structures). Simultaneously study graph algorithms (algorithms). Also train for CodeChef contests (competitive). Also watch System Design primer course. Spend 4 hours daily. Solve 30 DSA problems, write 5 graph solutions, attempt 1 CodeChef contest, watch 2 system design lectures.

