**Root Cause:** Learning language recommended by friends (Ruby) instead of market-standard language (Java/Python) meant zero internship prospects; language choice is determined by job market, not peer enthusiasm.

**Alternate Path:** Learn Python (market standard). Friends learn Ruby: okay. Your Python skills will open internship doors. Friends' Ruby skills: slower ROI.

