## Example 14: Watching coding tutorials at 2x speed without understanding
**Month 1-6:** Watch DSA tutorials at 2x speed (to save time). Passively consume. Miss nuances.

**Month 7:** Attempt problem. Can't solve (missed concept details due to speed-watching). Realize need to rewatch.

**Month 8:** Rewatch at 1x speed. Now understand. Lost 4 weeks to 2x-speed shortcut.

**Risk Level:** MEDIUM

**Root Cause:** Speed-watching sacrifices understanding for time saved; time saved (20%) is lost (400%) when concepts need re-learning.

**Alternate Path:** Watch at 1x speed. Take notes. Understand fully. Better time-investment.

