## Example 17: Skipping company-specific interview prep, using generic guides
**Month 8:** Interview at Amazon coming (Month 9). Use generic interview prep guides.

**Week before:** Realize Amazon has specific focus (system design, optimization). Generic prep didn't cover Amazon-specific topics.

**Month 9:** Amazon interview: weak on optimization (hadn't prepped specifically). Rejected.

**Risk Level:** MEDIUM

**Root Cause:** One-size-fits-all prep doesn't work; companies have different focuses (Amazon: optimization, Google: algorithm, Microsoft: system design).

**Alternate Path:** 3 weeks before Amazon interview: research Amazon interview patterns (what they ask). Targeted prep for Amazon-specific topics.

