## Example 21: Relying on ChatGPT/AI to solve problems instead of self
**Month 1-6:** For each problem, ask ChatGPT: "Solve this problem." Understand ChatGPT's solution.

**Month 7-8:** Attempt 10 problems without ChatGPT. Stuck on all (never developed independent problem-solving).

**Month 9:** Interview (no ChatGPT available). Can't solve. Rejected.

**Risk Level:** HIGH

**Root Cause:** AI solves problem for you, preventing struggle and learning; struggle is the learning.

**Alternate Path:** Use ChatGPT to understand (after you attempt and fail). Not to solve directly.

