## Example 23: Only practicing in one IDE/editor (language-specific)
**Month 1-8:** Practice all problems in VS Code. Comfortable with one environment. Never used online judges' editors.

**Month 9:** Real interview uses unfamiliar online judge. Slow due to environment unfamiliarity. Rejected.

**Risk Level:** LOW-MEDIUM

**Root Cause:** Environment switching causes distraction; should practice in environment similar to real interviews.

**Alternate Path:** Practice 50% in VS Code, 50% in LeetCode online editor. Comfortable in both.

