## Example 25: Skipping system design because "DSA is more important"
**Month 1-8:** Focus 100% DSA. System design completely ignored.

**Month 9:** Amazon interview (FAANG always asks system design). Weak answer (never studied). Rejected despite strong DSA.

**Risk Level:** MEDIUM-HIGH

**Root Cause:** FAANG interviews are 50% DSA, 50% system design. Skipping system design is incomplete prep.

**Alternate Path:** Month 1-6: DSA (80%) + system design intro (20%). Month 7-8: System design deep (with mocks). Month 9: Both ready.

