## Example 26: Not practicing mock interviews with camera on (hiding weakness)
**Month 1-8:** Mock interview with camera off (only audio). Never made eye contact, never saw self.

**Month 9:** Real interview: camera on. Uncomfortable. Fidgeting. Interviewer notices. Rejected.

**Risk Level:** MEDIUM

**Root Cause:** Camera-on interviews are different (visual feedback, body language matter). Practicing without camera doesn't prepare.

**Alternate Path:** All mocks: camera on, eyes looking at camera. Get comfortable with being seen while thinking.

