## Example 28: Reading about web development without building a project
**Month 1-6:** Read tutorials about React, Node.js, MongoDB. Understand concepts. Never built a complete project.

**Month 7:** Internship interview at startup: "Show us a project." No project to show. Rejected.

**Risk Level:** HIGH

**Root Cause:** Web development is practical skill; reading without building is incomplete learning.

**Alternate Path:** Read 1 week (fundamentals). Build project (3 weeks) applying those fundamentals. Repeat for next module.

