## Example 30: Watching coding walkthroughs instead of doing
**Month 1-8:** Watch 50 LeetCode video solutions (person walks through solution). Passive consumption.

**Month 9:** Code from scratch: forget how to approach independently. Rejected.

**Risk Level:** HIGH

**Root Cause:** Watching someone else code is not same as coding yourself; need to do it yourself.

**Alternate Path:** Watch walkthrough only if stuck after 30 min attempt. But always code independently first.

