## Example 46: Not explaining solutions aloud (only thinking)
**Month 1-8:** Solve problems, think through logic, code. Never explain aloud.

**Month 9:** Interview: need to explain approach. Unused to speaking thoughts aloud. Fumbles. Rejected.

**Risk Level:** MEDIUM

**Root Cause:** Interview requires communication. Silent thinking doesn't develop communication skill.

