## Example 48: Not testing assumptions before coding
**Month 1-8:** Make assumptions about input/constraints without reading carefully. Code based on wrong assumptions.

**Month 9:** Interview: assumptions wrong. Solution doesn't work. Rejected.

**Risk Level:** MEDIUM-HIGH

**Root Cause:** Assumptions create bugs. Testing assumptions first prevents wasted coding.

**Alternate Path:** Read problem. List assumptions. Confirm with interviewer. Then code.

