## Example 49: Only learning algorithms, not data structures
**Month 1-8:** Solve algorithm problems (BFS, DFS, DP). Never learn underlying data structures (hash tables, heaps, stacks).

**Month 9:** Interview: "Why use heap here?" Stammer (understand heap algorithm, not why heap is right choice). Rejected.

