## Example 50: Not doing post-interview analysis (no feedback loop)
**Month 1-8:** Do mock interviews. Get feedback: "Communication weak, approach needs optimization." Never address.

**Month 9:** Real interview: same weaknesses. Rejected.

**Later reflection:** Realized feedback was actionable but ignored.

**Risk Level:** HIGH

**Root Cause:** Feedback is useless without action. No feedback loop = no improvement.

**Alternate Path:** After each mock: identify top 3 weaknesses. Spend next week addressing them (targeted practice). Next mock: improved.

